    "summary": "<div class=\"field field-name-body field-type-text-with-summary field-label-hidden view-mode-rss\"><div class=\"field-items\"><div class=\"field-item even\"><h3><strong>For online payments through internet banking please use Council's bank account number:</strong></h3><ul><li>Council\u2019s bank account number is: \u00a0<strong>02-0348-0014307-000</strong></li><li>To enable Council to identify your payments please include two of the following three references (<strong>Owner\u2019s Surname</strong>,\u00a0<strong>Property Location</strong>\u00a0and/or\u00a0<strong>Valuation Number</strong>).</li></ul><p>Payments made after 10pm are\u00a0not be deposited into the Council bank account until the\u00a0<strong>next business day.\u00a0</strong></p><p>Please take this into consideration when making payments.</p><p>\u00a0</p><h3><strong>This payment method can be used when paying for:</strong></h3><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.kaweraudc.govt.nz/pay-rates\" rel=\"external\" title=\"Pay Rates\">Rates</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.kaweraudc.govt.nz/services/pay-it-online/pay-sundry-invoice\" rel=\"external\" title=\"Pay Sundry Invoice\">Sundry Invoice</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.kaweraudc.govt.nz/pay-dogs\" rel=\"external\" title=\"Pay Dog Registration\">Dog Registration</a></li></ul><p>\u00a0</p><p>\u00a0</p></div></div></div><section class=\"field field-name-field-show-i-want-to-block field-type-list-boolean field-label-above view-mode-rss\"><h2 class=\"field-label\">Show &#039;I want to&#039; Block:&nbsp;</h2><div class=\"field-items\"><div class=\"field-item even\">0</div></div></section><section class=\"field field-name-field-show-a-z-of-services-block field-type-list-boolean field-label-above view-mode-rss\"><h2 class=\"field-label\">Show &#039;A-Z of services&#039; Block:&nbsp;</h2><div class=\"field-items\"><div class=\"field-item even\">0</div></div></section><section class=\"field field-name-field-show-common-links-block field-type-list-boolea